# Mount Hyjal 1 (58-59): the first half of Mount Hyjal for a Horde duo: Elderwild, Mourning's Rest,
# the Barkskin furbolgs and Deadwood Den, the Felblood Scar and the Tainted Foothills. Not part of the
# leveling chain: a zone guide for players who want to finish Hyjal. Mount Hyjal 2 (59-60) follows.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/mount_hyjal_1_58_59.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite, Mount Hyjal: area 616, uiMap 2482), checked against
# outof.games (every Horde quest page of the zone). Wowhead refused the requests (403), so its
# comments were not used: the research is partial. RestedXP's Hyjal routes were a reference for
# hubs, order and tactics only.
#
# Starts in Orgrimmar: the auction house, then the flight to Bloodvenom Post in Felwood and the
# ride east into Mount Hyjal, to Elderwild, the Horde camp. Goes on to Everlook and Moonglade by
# air for Sebelia's mail, Nami's crate and Ketharas' pact. Ends at the Curious Crow in the Felblood
# Scar, where Mount Hyjal 2 (59-60) picks up.
#
# Carried in (optional breadcrumbs from other zones, their steps skip themselves without them):
# The Source of the Corruption (91952, Greta Mosshoof in Felwood) and A Cousin Abroad (97319,
# Argent Officer Garush in Tirisfal Glades).
# Left to Mount Hyjal 2, whose objectives or hand-ins are on its route: Heading Up the Mountain
# (96931), Taking to New Heights (92171), Rubble Rummage (92011), Top of the Post (93269), Feathers
# in Flight (92609), The Western Post (94782), Farsight Guided (96830), Windswept Wards (93827) and
# Barkskin Beginnings (94504).
#
# The whole zone, both guides: every Horde open-world quest of Mount Hyjal, elites and the WANTED
# ones too. Left out:
# - Alliance-only quests (Sefira Everbright's and Johun "Punchy" Dillas' camps, Fenwick
#   Togglespring, Belle's Ring...).
# - Beads for Brerufa (93925): repeatable.
# - The Demon Tower (92521): not in the game data (no level, no giver).
# - Quests outof.games lists for the zone that are not in our game data at all: the Guardians of
#   Hyjal crafting rewards (Friendly Advice and the like, Friendly or better), The Eyes of the
#   Spire, The Weight of the World, Blood Pact, Heart of Flesh, Heart of Stone, A Kingly Tribute,
#   The Path of Frost (some of them class quests), The Darkened Glaive and Ravenlock's Quest.
# - Red Bag Blues and Bookin' it Back (Nami): they need Frosty Favors from the D.E.L.T.A lab in
#   Tanaris and a warrior-only quest in the Burning Steppes.
# Reputation: the Barkskin Burrow's second round of quests waits for Barkskin Beginnings (Neutral)
# in Mount Hyjal 2, with a tip; Burrow Bonding (Friendly) comes last, with a tip to skip it if the
# pass falls short.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar's auction house; Bloodvenom Post and the ride into Elderwild; the Barkskin
# Burrow and the Deadwood camps; Mourning's Rest; Elderwild's hand-ins and the veteran's scabbard;
# Velician and the Felblood Scar (the Curious Crow and Felflick); the Tainted Foothills outpost,
# Ketharas' cave and Thark Gorax; Kaylaena's workshop and the summit for the flight path and
# Sebelia's mail; Everlook (Vizzie, Nami) and Moonglade (Orokai); back to the outpost, Kaylaena,
# Sunderbark, Ketharas and the Curious Crow.

