# Orgrimmar ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
ah 90854.1 npc 8673
ah 90854.2 npc 8673
tip Zet'gan in Elderwild wants 2 Rugged Armor Kits and a Cured Rugged Hide, Leatherworking goods nothing drops in Hyjal: buy them here or bring your own.
ah 95769.1 npc 8673
tip Kal'tinzan wants 6 Bolts of Runecloth.
ah 97119.1 npc 8673
tip Ortak Lomgok wants 6 Savory Stag Sliders.
