# Mourning's Rest --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 90865 bg
do 95026 bg
tip Mourning's Rest is the ruined Alliance camp east of Elderwild. Forgotten Soldiers and Fleshflay Raveners fill it; the Raveners' disease slows you for half an hour, so a cure helps.
do 92592 at 27.4,57.7 "Use the Survivor's Torch on the Bone Pile, then kill the Scourge Reanimator and loot his amulet"
tip The torch calls up a Scourge Reanimator, a level 59-60 caster: kill it together and loot the amulet.
accept 92100
tip The Veteran of the Third War, a ghostly soldier, shows himself near the ruins once you have killed some of the Scourge.
do 90865
tip The Eternal Sentries are stone gargoyles that pose still among the ruins: they wake when you come close.
do 95026
do 96616
tip The Hyjal Silphium grows at the foot of the trees just north-east of Mourning's Rest, on the edge of the Cradle of Tranquility.

